thinproxy (0.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Log a single outcome line per request: a denied or failed request no
    longer also emits an accepted request line.
  * Include the path in denial and resolve-failure lines for plain HTTP.
  * Report name-resolution failures as RESOLVE_FAILED with the client IP,
    destination, and reason.
  * Tag wildcard-port CONNECTs with WILDCARD_PORT on their outcome line.

